{
  "Name": "trailer-final",
  "Note": "The final trailer's plan (docs/trailer.md): scripts/trailer-plan.py writes the suites (bench/suites/trailer-final-<tier>-<n>.json, and -main for shots rendered in the main install) and the edit lists (bench/trailer/trailer-final-<tier>.json) from it. Music: the calm layer of 0-1's theme for the title and the first nine shots (44 bars), the battle layer from its step up (36.34 s into the song) for the next nine (32 bars, to its loop point), the calm layer again under the end card. 160 bpm: a bar is 1.5 s and the bars fall at 0.34 + 1.5 n, so the title is 0.34 s + 3 bars and every other clip a whole number of bars.",
  "Bar": 1.5,
  "Margin": 0.25,
  "PerRun": 5,
  "Labels": ["RT OFF", "PATH TRACED"],
  "Graphics": "motion",
  "Scenario": { "Enemies": "blind" },
